<title>MEXICO: Mexico's February average crude oil prices by type.</title>
<headline>Mexico's February average crude oil prices by type.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) updated average crude oil prices for February on Friday.</p>
<p>Below follows a comparative table of prices, by type and region exported.</p>
<p>    Type		  Feb. 97	   Jan. 97</p>
<p>America</p>
<p>    Maya		    15.67	     18.64</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 20.09	     23.20</p>
<p>    Olmeca		  21.58	     24.50</p>
<p>Europe</p>
<p>    Maya		    14.39	     16.66</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 18.48	     21.10</p>
<p>Far East</p>
<p>    Maya		    15.91	     18.54</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 19.86	     22.49</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
